# Architecture Rules

- `domain/` — pure Kotlin, no Android imports
- Game logic: `GameEngine`; bots: `BotAI`; bot nicknames: `BotNames` (Hollywood + Russian classics, Russian strings)
- Offline human seat label: `GameConfig.OFFLINE_HUMAN_DISPLAY_NAME` (`"Вы"`) — not profile display name
- All game actions go through `GameClient` (`LocalGameClient` now; remote later)
- ViewModels call `GameClient`, never `GameEngine` directly
- `observeState()` Flow for tick polling; `getState()` after actions
- Actions: `playCard`, `addCard`, `pass`, `bito`, `ready`, `leaveSession`
- DTOs in `data/api/dto/` with `@Serializable`; map in repository / `LocalGameClient`

```kotlin
// ✅ ViewModel
gameClient.playCard(sessionId, card, targetPairId)

// ❌ ViewModel
gameEngine.playCard(card)
```
